     _c_a_c_h_e_l_i_m_i_t   Limit on the total number of entries in the ssyynnccaacchhee.  De‐
                  faults to (_h_a_s_h_s_i_z_e × _b_u_c_k_e_t_l_i_m_i_t), may be set lower to min‐
