HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The existing ssyynnccaacchhee implementation first appeared in FreeBSD 4.5.  The
     original concept of a ssyynnccaacchhee originally appeared in BSD/OS, and was
     later modified by NetBSD, then further extended here.

